---
---

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-box">
      <h2 class="cta-title">¿Tu familia quiere participar?</h2>
      <p class="cta-desc">
        Comparte fotos, videos y testimonios de tu hogar con la comunidad de FamiliaLee.
      </p>
      <a href="/auth/registro" class="cta-btn">
        Unirse ahora
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a href="/" class="footer-logo" aria-label="FamiliaLee inicio">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="4" width="13" height="16" rx="2" stroke="#c8872a" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M7 8h5M7 12h5M7 16h3" stroke="#c8872a" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M16 6l3 2-3 2V6z" fill="#0d2240"/>
          </svg>
          <span>FamiliaLee</span>
        </a>
        <p class="footer-desc">
          Una comunidad de familias, autores e iglesias que comparten el amor por la lectura y la fe cristiana.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="footer-verse">
          "Instruye al niño en su camino, y aun cuando fuere viejo no se apartará de él." — <cite>Proverbios 22:6</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Explorar">
        <h3>EXPLORAR</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/biblioteca">Biblioteca</a></li>
          <li><a href="/autores">Autores</a></li>
          <li><a href="/galeria-familiar">Galería Familiar</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recursos">Recursos</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Cuenta">
        <h3>CUENTA</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/auth/registro">Registrarse</a></li>
          <li><a href="/auth/login">Ingresar</a></li>
          <li><a href="/panel">Mi Panel</a></li>
          <li><a href="/admin">Administrador</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>&copy; 2026 FamiliaLee. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <p class="footer-heart">Hecho con <span aria-label="amor">♥</span> para las familias</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }

  .cta-box {
    background: var(--color-cream-dark);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .cta-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem;
    background: var(--color-navy);
    color: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .cta-btn:hover {
    background: var(--color-navy-light);
  }

  /* Footer */
  .footer {
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 3.5rem 0 0;
  }

  .footer-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-logo span {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .footer-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 320px;
  }

  .footer-verse {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-gold);
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .footer-nav h3 {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .footer-nav ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .footer-nav a {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-nav a:hover {
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .footer-heart {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .footer-heart span {
    color: #c8872a;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
